{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03177","headline":"巫峡 · 杨炯","name":"巫峡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三峡七百里，唯言巫峡长。\n重岩窅不极，叠嶂凌苍苍。\n绝壁横天险，莓苔烂锦章。\n入夜分明见，无风波浪狂。\n忠信吾所蹈，泛舟亦何伤。\n可以涉砥柱，可以浮吕梁。\n美人今何在？灵芝徒有芳。\n山空夜猿啸，征客泪沾裳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03177.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03177","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}